'''Palliduvans''' were a [[near-human]] [[species]] From the [[Wild Space]] planet [[Palliduva system|Palliduva]], characterized by their lanky frames, chalk-[[Color|white]] skin, and long, [[Bone|bony]] fingers<ref name="DB" /> used to draw [[blood]].<ref name="Character Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars Character Encyclopedia: Updated and Expanded]]''</ref> Palliduvans included the [[bounty hunter]] [[Aurra Sing]] and the [[pirate]] [[Valik]].<ref name="DB" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Palliduvans first appeared in the [[1999]] film [[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace|''Star Wars'': Episode I ''The Phantom Menace'']], the first installment of the ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[prequel trilogy]].<ref name="Episode I" /> They were first identified in the [[2019]] episode guide for "[[The Doza Dilemma]]," an episode of the television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]''.<ref name="Bucket's List">{{BucketsList|aL8Jriu0JdM|#1.15: "The Doza Dilemma"|sw_url=video/buckets-list-the-doza-dilemma-star-wars-resistance}}</ref>

In [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]], [[Aurra Sing/Legends|Aurra Sing]] was a [[Hybrid/Legends|hybrid]] of a [[Human/Legends|Human]] and [[Aurra Sing's father's species|near-Human species]].<ref name="Tempest">''[[Legacy of the Force: Tempest]]''</ref>

